silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_concrete_anchor_6#validatedkgartifact silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidatedKgArtifact is The kg-value artifact after shape validation. The validate arrow lands here; the shape gate validates the kg-value artifact. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'CheckedArtifact', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
